# Haraka plugin list. Haraka loads these in order and fires each
# one's hooks during the SMTP conversation.
#
# Minimal stack for an SMTP → HTTP shim:
#   - tls is added at the top by the entrypoint when a certificate is
#     mounted (the Helm chart's public MX), for STARTTLS.
#   - orbital-webhook is our custom plugin. It rejects any recipient
#     Orbital doesn't know at RCPT time (so this is no open relay) and
#     POSTs accepted mail to Laravel at end-of-DATA.
#   - dnsbl / spf / dkim_verify are OFF. In the Helm chart Haraka sits
#     behind Traefik and sees Traefik's address, not the sender's, so
#     IP-based checks would judge the wrong host. They can be turned on
#     once the sender's address is passed through (PROXY protocol).

orbital-webhook
